        en: "Discover the mysterious underwater world surrounding Sazan Island, home to rare marine species, vibrant reefs, and remnants of historic military structures. With excellent visibility and a sense of adventure around every corner, divers can explore tunnels, shipwrecks, and natural rock formations. This unique combination of history and nature makes Sazan Island one of Albania’s most fascinating and sought-after diving destinations.",
